# SurfCPU: SHA-256 of the generated LiteDRAM files the DDR designs build from (paths relative
# to surfcpu/, sha256sum format). File: arty.sha256, written by ip/litedram/lock.sh write.
# generate: make litedram-gen
# ip/litedram/generate.sh makes them byte for byte the same on every run, in the toolchain
# image surfcpu-toolchain:2026-10-15 (whose RISC-V GCC compiles the calibration BIOS) from the
# generator ip/litedram/setup.sh pins, ip/litedram/arty.yml and SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
# 1790239353 (the LiteDRAM commit's time). tools/fpga-build.sh and
# make litedram-gen check them (ip/litedram/lock.sh check). The last line is the simulation
# core (make test-ddr-litedram), not part of any bitstream.
